    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Some people are just unhappy regardless of their situation. \n\nTrying to make someone who is fundamentally unhappy happy is a fool's errand. They have to consciously make the decision and change for themselves.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051774910029074665",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T21:23:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I'm amused by people who think rich people don't pay taxes.\n\nI don't even know where that idea came from.\n\nIt's not just false, it's an anti-truth.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051757308405858336",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T20:13:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Everything will work out in the long run... Things will change and there will be disruption, as always, but humanity isn't going anywhere.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051756436963618932",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T20:10:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A huge black pill is realising that millions of Millennials and Gen Z didn't even make it out their mother's womb.\n\nBeyond sad.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051734879293886636",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T18:44:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Looks like another trip to Austin, Texas is on the cards this month.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051726942810828833",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T18:13:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "'Brainwashing' is real but if you allow yourself to be brainwashed as an adult, it's still your fault.\n\nALL of us are constantly exposed to propaganda. Learn discernment.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051361436291477673",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T18:00:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Real Talk with Zuby podcast with @peterboghossian out now.\n\nWatch:\npiped.video/Nb5OO86rGh4?si=in4z\u2026\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051446260675010823",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T23:37:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Banger.\n\n\nConnor Boyack \ud83d\udcda (@cboyack)\n\nInflation is a tax that no one voted for, falls hardest on the poor, and gets blamed on everyone except the people printing the money.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/cboyack/status/2051386892789408075#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051402288070119924",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T20:43:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "As an adult, it has never even crossed my mind that I am ENTITLED to other people's attention, time, work, or money.\n\nI'm grateful for everybody who has supported me in any way, and I try to pay it forward.\n\nBut the entitlement level some people have is horrible.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051393200858845532",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T20:07:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Today I learned that I'm not a real Christian because I live in Dubai and have two ads on my podcast. \ud83d\ude43\n\nGod forbid a man earns from his work and takes care of his family.\n\nYouTube comments FTW.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051384419827449983",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T19:32:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I've found people who hate billionaires to be more greedy and materialistic than actual billionaires.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051375496957477141",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T18:56:45+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "P.S. If you're going to be brainwashed, then let it be into something that serves you and society. Not something stupid and harmful.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2051362190897074286",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T18:03:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I actually like Mondays. Surely, I'm not alone?",
